<title>USA: BNH Bancshares Inc Q3 shr up.</title>
<headline>BNH Bancshares Inc Q3 shr up.</headline>
<dateline>NEW HAVEN, Conn. 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $2.21		    $0.10</p>
<p> Net			  8,132			353</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   3,682		    3,682</p>
<p>	     MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $2.62		    $0.21</p>
<p> Net			  9,637			788</p>
<p> Avg shrs		     N/A			N/A</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Q3 1996 includes income tax benefit of $7.51 million, or $2.04 per share, as the company reduced its valuation allowance on its deferred tax asset.</p>
<p>Q3 1996 provision for loan losses $500,000 vs $775,000, and for year to date $1.6 million vs $3.1 million.</p>
<p>Assets at September 30 $321 million vs $296.5 million.</p>
<p>Deposits at September 30 $282.9 million vs $273.3 million.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
